# Auth Platform Boundaries

This repo is the **identity platform**, not Byte Forge marketplace.

## Own here

- End-user identity (accounts, credentials, MFA)
- OIDC/OAuth2 issuer (clients, tokens, JWKS)
- Sessions and refresh token lifecycle
- Platform operator admin APIs
- Security audit log

## Do not add here

- Shops, products, orders, carts, campaigns, subscriptions
- Marketplace seller/buyer authorization (consumer apps own domain RBAC)
- Payment processing, Stripe, Cloudinary, plant catalog

## Integration

Consumer apps (Byte Forge) authenticate via OIDC and map `sub` → local `user_identities`. Keep that mapping in the consumer app, not in this repo.
